 "remarks": "Sunny, gracious and on one of Darien's most beloved lanes, 37 Knollwood Lane awaits the next lucky homeowner. Warm and welcoming throughout, sunlit rooms and an intuitive floorplan facilitates a gracious, easy lifestyle. A mile from Darien's town center and train, and a short walk to Royle Elementary, the next owner will enjoy the quiet of a flat acre on a cul de sac with the convenience of being close to everything. Five bedrooms, four and a half bathrooms and a bonus room with a fieldstone fireplace provide plenty of room for everyone, without feeling overwhelmingly large. A 2021 gunite pool and a large patio set the stage for summer entertaining. New roof in 2021 and a new furnace in 2025. After many happy memories in this house, 37 Knollwood welcomes the next generation of memories made.",
